      <langSet xml:lang="zh-CN"><tig><term>造父变星</term></tig></langSet>
      <descrip type="subjectField">天文</descrip>
      <descrip type="definition">光变周期与绝对光度密切相关的脉动变星</descrip>
    </termEntry>
